From acfcf5cb9e8a911810bf02a1e6193367e5895d38 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?=E9=99=B6=E5=B0=BC?= <taoni.nt@alibaba-inc.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 17:34:49 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 16/16] feat(terway): handle trunk VLAN egress with a datapath
 plugin

Push the endpoint VLAN after the Cilium host egress program while preserving policy verdicts and endpoint identity across NAT and tail calls. Normalize legacy PIPE only when TCX is in use.

Guard mode mismatches and unsupported routing configurations, keep VLAN bindings in sync with endpoint deletion, and document opt-in migration requirements.

Validate with Linux kernel dispatcher tests, race checks for allocation and map state, Hive population, and Linux arm64/amd64 agent and CNI builds. Existing endpoint fixture failures also reproduce on the unchanged baseline; cloud trunk-node integration remains pending.
